meta {
  name: 5. Purchase Content
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/content/{{contentId}}/purchase
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Telegram-Init-Data: {{initDataB}}
}

docs {
  Charges User B's wallet and pays User A (the item's owner) their net
  share, via the real credit ledger — see TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENTS.md
  section 10. Only works on an item with is_paid: true (upload one with
  the paid combo first, see "1. Upload Content" docs).

  Run "2. Dev Top Up (B)" (Wallet folder) first, or this returns 402.
  Note this now needs {{initDataB}}, not {{initData}} — User A is the
  item's owner and can't purchase their own paid content (400).

  Calling this again after already owning the item is safe (still 201,
  no second charge).
}
